  "validation_notes": [
    "The new regressions reproduced scaled menu animations, missing stamina recovery for stationary followers, and portrait clicks selecting instead of following in the unmodified source.",
    "The rendered input fixture waits for HUD fitting after selection changes before resolving portrait coordinates. Headless checks resolve cursor eligibility directly because they have no OS pointer.",
    "An existing direct-control tooltip typed-array error found during regression testing was corrected; direct spell selection now completes without script errors.",
    "Menu clips use wall time; their opening and hover durations were checked at half, normal and accelerated game speed, with and without a paused scene tree.",
    "Browser upgrade checks compare every IndexedDB store, including isolated game-data and save-file sentinels. They do not represent a complete saved campaign playthrough."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Runtime tests ran on the packaged Linux build. Windows, macOS and Android packages were audited without runtime tests on their target operating systems. macOS is unsigned.",
    "Linux UI was rendered with Compatibility and checked in English, Russian and German. Original EN/RU/DE archives supply the existing captions; no player-visible strings changed.",
    "Portrait tests inject mouse input and use the normal authority handler. They do not exercise a physical input device or a live network peer.",
    "Browser checks cover setup, cache replacement, storage preservation and error logs, not a complete campaign."
  ],
  "deployment_verification": "Live asset hashes and browser startup must pass before the draft release is published; receipts are retained in the release workspace."
